[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]Installation[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST=1]
[*]Download [ICODE]pvpindex-mcbans-<version>.jar[/ICODE] from [URL='https://github.com/PVP-Index/pvpindex-mcbans/releases']GitHub Releases[/URL].
[*]Drop the JAR into your server's [ICODE]plugins/[/ICODE] folder and start the server - [ICODE]plugins/MCBans/config.yml[/ICODE] is generated automatically.
[*][URL='https://pvpindex.com/apply']Apply for an API key[/URL], then set it in config:
[CODE=yaml]pvpindex:
  apiKey: "your-bearer-token-here"[/CODE]
[*]Reload with [ICODE]/mcbans reload[/ICODE] or restart the server.
[*]Run [ICODE]/mcbans sync[/ICODE] to pull the current ban list from the network.
[/LIST]

→ Full guide: [URL='https://docs.pvpindex.com/mcbans/installation']docs.pvpindex.com/mcbans/installation[/URL]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]Commands[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B]Ban commands[/B][/SIZE]

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Command[/TH]
[TH]Permission[/TH]
[TH]Description[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/ban <player> [reason][/ICODE][/TD]
[TD][ICODE]mcbans.ban.local[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]Issue a local ban[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/ban <player> g <reason>[/ICODE] · [ICODE]/gban[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD][ICODE]mcbans.ban.global[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]Issue a global ban (synced network-wide)[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/ban <player> t <n> <m|h|d|w> [reason][/ICODE] · [ICODE]/tban[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD][ICODE]mcbans.ban.temp[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]Temporary ban with auto-expiry[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/banip <ip> [reason][/ICODE] · [ICODE]/ipban[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD][ICODE]mcbans.ban.ip[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]Ban an IP address[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/unban <player|IP|UUID>[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD][ICODE]mcbans.unban[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]Remove any active ban[/TD]
[/TR]
[/TABLE]

[SIZE=4][B]Moderation commands[/B][/SIZE]

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Command[/TH]
[TH]Permission[/TH]
[TH]Description[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/kick <player> [reason][/ICODE][/TD]
[TD][ICODE]mcbans.kick[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]Kick a player without banning[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/lookup <player|UUID>[/ICODE] · [ICODE]/lup[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD][ICODE]mcbans.lookup.player[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]View a player's ban history[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/banlookup <id>[/ICODE] · [ICODE]/blup[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD][ICODE]mcbans.lookup.ban[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]View a specific ban record by ID[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/altlookup <player|UUID>[/ICODE] · [ICODE]/alup[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD][ICODE]mcbans.lookup.alt[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]Show known alternate accounts[/TD]
[/TR]
[/TABLE]

[SIZE=4][B]Admin commands[/B][/SIZE]

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Command[/TH]
[TH]Description[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/mcbans[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]Show help[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/mcbans reload[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]Reload config and language files[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][ICODE]/mcbans sync[/ICODE][/TD]
[TD]Force an immediate push + download cycle[/TD]
[/TR]
[/TABLE]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]Configuration Snapshot[/B][/SIZE]

[CODE=yaml]pvpindex:
  apiUrl:       https://api.pvpindex.com
  apiKey:       ""            # ← paste your key here
  syncInterval: 60            # background sync in minutes

storage:
  backend: sqlite             # sqlite | mysql | postgresql

language:   default
permission: SuperPerms        # SuperPerms | Vault

failsafe: false               # true = block all logins when API unreachable[/CODE]

→ Full reference: [URL='https://docs.pvpindex.com/mcbans/configuration']docs.pvpindex.com/mcbans/configuration[/URL]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]Developer API (JitPack)[/B][/SIZE]

Add the lightweight API client to your own plugin - no Bukkit dependency required:

[CODE=xml]<repositories>
    <repository>
        <id>jitpack</id>
        <url>https://jitpack.io</url>
    </repository>
</repositories>
<dependency>
    <groupId>com.github.PVP-Index.pvpindex-mcbans</groupId>
    <artifactId>pvpindex-mcbans-api</artifactId>
    <version>1.0.0</version>
</dependency>[/CODE]

→ [URL='https://docs.pvpindex.com/mcbans/developer-api']Developer API documentation[/URL]

